!Version 1

// The engine's own shaders: one package, a namespace per directory (this one is
// `Marlin.Engine`, a subdirectory `Post/` would be `Marlin.Engine.Post`). The engine finds the
// cooked library by the package's name and each entry point by its full path.
ShaderPackage
{
    !Uuid = "01a14e23-41a7-7240-a3d8-65abdeb55b0e"
    !Name = "Marlin.Engine"
    Sources = [`source:shaders/Forward.mshader`, `source:shaders/Post/Post.mshader`]
}
